Z||000001||Standard||12-03-2000||02:56 AM||||eep!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif">  Looks like you nabbed 'em off the back of a chevy truck!  A little.. ricey for my tastes.  Pipes like that belong on the back of trucks and 5.0 mustangs, imho.  If you like 'em, more power to ya.  Just letting ya know what I think  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Mike -<BR>Black 86.5 GT 5 Spd, 153,000 miles and some busted up ground f/x  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/redface.gif"> <BR>Red 84 Sport Coupe - winter donut maker    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/asthanos.gif"> ||||reg||11
