Z||000032||Raydar||12-05-2000||10:46 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Xtreme Fiero's:<BR><B>...does anybody sell a straight through exhaust? </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>IRM has one. Stainless. Uses about two feet of the original system, after the cat. Has a "T" at the rear. Uses Hooker resonators.<BR>I had this system and thought it was obnoxious. You couldn't even talk with the windows down.<BR>Had a "bullet" glasspack welded in, upstream of the "T". Still loud enough to set off car alarms in the parking deck, but sounds good.<P>||||reg||1
